@startuml
title Validation d'une Tâche (Solo)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8
skinparam BoxPadding 5
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceDividerFontSize 10

autonumber

actor       "Acheteur"      as Buyer
participant "Frontend"      as Client
participant "Serveur"       as API
participant "Agent"         as Agent   #LightGreen
participant "Juges [x3]"    as Judges  #LightYellow
participant "IPFS"          as IPFS
participant "MetaMask"      as MM      #LightPink
participant "ValidationReg" as VR      #LightBlue
participant "ReputationReg" as RR      #LightBlue

== Exécution ==

Buyer   ->  Client  : requête(prompt)
activate Client
Client  ->  API     : exécuter(idTâche, prompt)
activate API
API     ->  Agent   : run(prompt)
activate Agent
Agent  -->  API     : (sortie, trace)
deactivate Agent
API     ->  IPFS    : upload(sortie, trace)
activate IPFS
IPFS   -->  API     : proxyCID
deactivate IPFS

== Validation on-chain ==

API     ->  VR      : validationRequest(idTâche, agentId, proxyCID)
activate VR
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR
API     ->  VR      : assignJudges(idTâche, candidats)
activate VR
VR     ->  VR       : emit JudgesAssigned(idsJuges)
VR     -->  API     : idsJuges
deactivate VR
API     ->  Judges  : eval(proxyCID)
activate Judges
Judges ->>  IPFS    : get(proxyCID)
activate IPFS
IPFS  -->   Judges  : trace
deactivate IPFS
Judges -->  API     : scores
deactivate Judges

== Commit - Reveal ==

API     ->  VR      : commitVote(idTâche, idJuge, hash) [x3]
activate VR
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR
API     ->  VR      : revealVote(idTâche, idJuge, vote, scores) [x3]
activate VR
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR
API     ->  VR      : finaliseValidation(idTâche, justifURI)
activate VR
VR     ->  VR       : emit ScoreRecorded(agentId, score)
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR

== Réputation ==

API    ->>  API     : eigenTrust(agentId) [backend]
activate API
API     ->  RR      : setEigenTrustScore(tokenId, score)
activate RR
RR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate RR
deactivate API

Buyer   ->  Client  : donner avis (stars)
activate Client
Client  ->  MM      : signer tx giveFeedback(tokenId, stars)
activate MM
MM      ->  RR      : giveFeedback(tokenId, stars)
activate RR
RR      ->  RR      : emit FeedbackGiven(tokenId, stars)
RR     -->  MM      : ok
deactivate RR
MM     -->  Client  : tx confirmée
deactivate MM
deactivate Client

API    ->>  API     : finalScore = eigenTrust × feedback [read-time]

API    -->  Client  : (sortie, score)
deactivate API
Client -->  Buyer   : résultat(sortie, verdict)
deactivate Client

@enduml
